    {
      "id": "tr_noggin",
      "en": "Give me your noggin",
      "it": "Su con la capoccia",
      "alternates": [
        "Fuori la testolina!",
        "Dammi la testolina",
        "Dov'è quella testolina?",
        "Fai passare la testolina"
      ],
      "pos": "phrase",
      "register": "child",
      "gender": "f",
      "region": "central / Tuscan",
      "slots": {},
      "note": "Dressing a child. Capoccia = noggin, comic, alive in Tuscany and Lazio; in Tuscany it also means head of household/farm (mezzadria sense). Head exits the collar, so fuori, never dentro. Avoid pera (dominated by heroin slang); testina reads as printer/stylus head."
    },
    {
